                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the average Google Ads CPC in India for eCommerce?</h3>
                                        <p>₹6-65 depending on industry. Jewelry highest; F&B lowest.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Performance Max worth using?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes with proper setup — exclude brand terms, provide 30+ image + 10+ video assets, add audience signals. Delivers 20-35% lower CPA vs manual campaigns for most eCommerce.</p>
                                        <h3>Google Ads or Meta Ads — which for eCommerce?</h3>
